00:38:28.173 --> 00:38:31.003
because it'll be all over in the morning.

00:38:32.667 --> 00:38:34.993
And my point to society.

00:38:36.190 --> 00:38:39.308
If you don't put so much into life

00:38:39.308 --> 00:38:41.993
about what you don't have,

00:38:43.934 --> 00:38:46.263
and appreciate the things that you do,

00:38:50.020 --> 00:38:52.913
you won't stress out as hard.

00:38:54.980 --> 00:38:59.110
And it won't mean as much to you

00:39:00.730 --> 00:39:04.790
no matter what you get or
whatever you lose in life.

00:39:04.790 --> 00:39:06.813
You always still got your life.

00:39:08.030 --> 00:39:11.623
And I doubt I'll ever have
a Christmas or a birthday.

00:39:12.660 --> 00:39:14.653
'Cause I'm 63 years old now.

00:39:15.720 --> 00:39:17.170
But that doesn't bother me,

00:39:17.170 --> 00:39:18.980
because I've had a lot of birthdays,

00:39:18.980 --> 00:39:20.993
and a lot of Christmases, you know why?

00:39:22.030 --> 00:39:23.730
'Cause it's not about the present,

00:39:24.930 --> 00:39:26.713
or what somebody give you.

00:39:28.950 --> 00:39:31.440
It's about being here.

00:39:31.440 --> 00:39:33.213
63 years later.

00:39:34.760 --> 00:39:37.640
Where all my friends got
shot down from gang banging

00:39:37.640 --> 00:39:41.650
or killed for some reason.

00:39:41.650 --> 00:39:43.650
Or the rest of them
went to prison for life.

00:39:43.650 --> 00:39:47.363
I'm an old man, I have no
friends or homeboys left.

00:39:48.840 --> 00:39:51.923
Because the ones I had are dead.

00:39:52.970 --> 00:39:55.467
Or in prison for the rest of they life.

00:39:55.467 --> 00:39:59.333
And they had birthdays, and
they got presents for Christmas.

00:40:00.720 --> 00:40:03.253
But they're dead or
they're in prison for life.

00:40:04.780 --> 00:40:07.703
I didn't get presents,
I didn't get birthdays.

00:40:09.690 --> 00:40:11.163
But I'm alive and free.

00:40:13.260 --> 00:40:15.970
So, no one will have it all.

00:40:15.970 --> 00:40:18.253
No one will ever have it all.

00:40:19.745 --> 00:40:22.950
And don't look at this water on my face

00:40:22.950 --> 00:40:25.510
and think I'm sad, because I'm not.

00:40:25.510 --> 00:40:27.543
The man that's doing this interview,

00:40:29.920 --> 00:40:31.773
God brought him into my life.

00:40:32.640 --> 00:40:33.903
And he's a good man.

00:40:35.360 --> 00:40:38.787
And about two months ago I met this man.

00:40:40.650 --> 00:40:44.763
Before I met him, I was
still appreciating life.

00:40:46.060 --> 00:40:49.990
But it was just a little
bit harder before I met him.

00:40:49.990 --> 00:40:52.693
And he made it just a
little easier for me.

00:40:54.190 --> 00:40:57.450
And so no matter how many videos I do,

00:40:57.450 --> 00:40:58.590
I'll do them all for him,

00:40:58.590 --> 00:41:00.243
and I hope he do well with them.

00:41:01.260 --> 00:41:05.070
And I hope these videos
will help a lot of people,

00:41:05.070 --> 00:41:07.080
because that's what he's here for.

00:41:07.080 --> 00:41:08.020
To help people.

00:41:08.020 --> 00:41:09.853
And he's a good man.

00:41:10.691 --> 00:41:12.473
And he keep bringing me back,

00:41:13.730 --> 00:41:16.210
so he can get literature like this.

00:41:16.210 --> 00:41:18.557
Not that he doesn't know it himself,

00:41:18.557 --> 00:41:19.890
but he wanted to have somebody

00:41:19.890 --> 00:41:22.503
who had been through it tell him.

00:41:25.840 --> 00:41:28.823
And he didn't need my help, I needed his.

00:41:30.460 --> 00:41:33.380
And I'm glad he did come into my life.

00:41:33.380 --> 00:41:36.713
And I'm hoping that all young
people could use this video.

00:41:37.800 --> 00:41:39.677
And see something here they can use.

00:41:39.677 --> 00:41:43.993
And remember, it's about
living and enjoying life.

00:41:45.110 --> 00:41:48.393
Not enjoying things, because
things will always come and go.

00:41:49.823 --> 00:41:54.220
But your children and that
human flesh, that woman,

00:41:54.220 --> 00:41:57.083
your brother, your sister, your mother.

00:41:58.900 --> 00:42:02.014
You'll only have them for
a short period of time.

00:42:02.014 --> 00:42:04.797
That means, one day,
some babies die at birth.

00:42:08.150 --> 00:42:10.280
So that means you could
have your loved ones

00:42:10.280 --> 00:42:13.303
for one day to 100 years.

00:42:14.290 --> 00:42:17.790
But they'll only be here
for a short period of time.

00:42:17.790 --> 00:42:20.550
And if you don't do the
right thing by them,

00:42:20.550 --> 00:42:23.411
or by each other, while you here,

00:42:23.411 --> 00:42:26.743
sometimes you will lose
that chance to do that.

00:42:27.780 --> 00:42:30.053
And when you lose that chance to do that,

00:42:31.040 --> 00:42:33.090
it will be something you will regret

00:42:33.964 --> 00:42:35.600
the rest of your natural life.

00:42:35.600 --> 00:42:37.520
In life and in death.

00:42:37.520 --> 00:42:39.290
And you might not feel it now.

00:42:39.290 --> 00:42:41.630
'Cause we never miss
the things we truly love

00:42:41.630 --> 00:42:45.210
until it is gone and we
don't have it no more.

00:42:45.210 --> 00:42:48.610
That's when we turn 'round and we miss it.

00:42:48.610 --> 00:42:50.360
Like when we used to go to jail.

00:42:50.360 --> 00:42:53.190
We would always get to jail
after the police catch us,

00:42:53.190 --> 00:42:55.960
and say oh I coulda did
this I coulda did that.

00:42:55.960 --> 00:42:58.023
But it's too late now, you in jail.

00:42:58.970 --> 00:43:01.744
It's too late now that
person's dead and gone.

00:43:01.744 --> 00:43:03.270
Or moved away.

00:43:03.270 --> 00:43:07.410
'Cause in the end, no
matter what your belief is,

00:43:07.410 --> 00:43:11.850
you gotta remember Cigarette
Man belief is being with God.

00:43:11.850 --> 00:43:14.600
That's why I've never had
a tattoo or pierced ear,

00:43:14.600 --> 00:43:17.340
a driver's license or a phone in my life.

00:43:17.340 --> 00:43:20.130
I've never had any manmade appliances.

00:43:20.130 --> 00:43:22.320
There's no tattoos, no pierced ears,

00:43:22.320 --> 00:43:24.700
never had a driver's license, a phone.

00:43:24.700 --> 00:43:26.170
None of that.

00:43:26.170 --> 00:43:27.643
I'm a computer illiterate.

00:43:28.630 --> 00:43:30.360
But I have met some good people

00:43:30.360 --> 00:43:32.000
who have taught me just as much

00:43:32.000 --> 00:43:34.400
as that computer has taught you.

00:43:34.400 --> 00:43:36.120
So let's have a good day people.

00:43:36.120 --> 00:43:38.880
Take care of your children,
love your loved ones.

00:43:38.880 --> 00:43:40.983
This is me saying goodbye, Cigarette Man.

00:43:44.440 --> 00:43:45.363
- [Mark] That's great.

